about_title=About kblswitch
app_version=Version 2.0.0.0
about_text=KBLSWITCH is a keyboard layout switcher with visual notifications.\n\nFeatures:\n• Switch layout with a single key (e.g. "Right Alt") emulating the system combination (e.g. Ctrl+Shift);\n• Fix the layout of the last typed word: F8 - Russian→English, F9 - English→Russian;\n• OSD indicator of the current language in the center of the screen (color, opacity, "always on screen" mode with dragging);\n• Layout indicator near the text caret (or the mouse pointer);\n• Modern settings window with instant apply;\n• Two interface languages: Russian and English.\n\nThe app lives in the system tray; context menu - Settings • About • Exit.
